Package: OmicLoupe
Title: Taking a Closer Look at Omics Data
Version: 1.1.7
Authors@R: c(person("Jakob", "Willforss", email="jakob.willforss@hotmail.com", role=c("aut", "cre")))
Description:
    Interactive Shiny application for exploring and comparing omics datasets,
    including data quality summaries, principal component analysis, overlap
    visualization, and correlation-based views.
